     H*****************************************************************
     H* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  09/27/07 C:183PROJECT: 71WIA                                 *
     H*                ADDED A NEW FIELD "RETRO CREDIT A/R BATCH#     *
     H*                                                               *
     H*  11/21/96 C:65 PROJECT: CM023                                 *
     H*                ADDED FOUR NEW FIELDS: BLAGT#,BLRFLG,BLPFDT,   *
     H*                AND BLSTEP FOR COMMERCIAL PROCESSING.          *
     H*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PBL01                     TEXT('BILL TRANSACTION FILE')
     A            BLCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            BLFND     R               REFFLD(FND)
     A            BLFYR     R               REFFLD(FYR)
     A            BLEMP#    R               REFFLD(EMP#)
     A            BLDIV     R               REFFLD(DIV)
     A            BLFLG1    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('BILLING FLAG')
     A            BLFLG2    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('AUDIT FLAG')
     A            BLFLG3    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('UPDATE A/R FLAG')
     A            BLSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            BLUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            BLPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            BLTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            BLDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE' 'MAINTAINED')
     A*** BEGIN ADD ***  11/21/96  ************************************
     A            BLAGT#    R               REFFLD(AGT#)
     A                                      COLHDG('AGENT #')
     A            BLRFLG    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('RENEWAL FLAG')
     A            BLPFDT    R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('POLICY EFF DATE')
     A            BLSTEP    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('PRINT STEP FLAG')
     A*** END ADD *****  11/21/96  ************************************
     A*** BEG ADD *****  09/27/07  ************************************
     A            BLARQ#         9S 0       COLHDG('RETRO CREDIT ' +
     A                                      'A/R BATCH#')
     A*** END ADD *****  09/27/07  ************************************
